---
description: Design and review documents stay in separate directories
globs: docs/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

# Documentation placement

- Design (normative intent) → `docs/design/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>.md`
- Reviews (verdicts, findings, cuts) → `docs/reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>.md`
- Agent operations → `docs/agents/`
- Plans and proto-specs (`*-intent.md`) → `docs/plans/`
- User guides → `docs/guides/`

Do not mix review findings into a design file. Do not add design or review files at the repository root. Do not silently rewrite a design to match an implementation shortcut.
